  "description": "<p>The DC datastream that is shown with uri's like <a href=\"http://blabla/get/changeme:001/DC\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://blabla/get/changeme:001/DC</a> uses the wrong namespace. It should be <a href=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/</a> (with trailing slash) instead of <a href=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1</a> (without slash).<br/>\nFortunately, the object xml itself and uri's in the RI index are correct.</p>",
